rTour(weight:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" documents; nil below three vertices.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The defaults scale with the input: the temperature starts at a third of the starting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tour’s mean edge weight, so a move adding one typical edge’s weight is taken about once in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"twenty at first and ever more rarely as the temperature falls, and a round tries ten moves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"per vertex. Starting from a "},{"code":"twoOptTour(improving:weight:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than the nearest-neighbour"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tour gives the search a shorter tour to improve on."}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The graph is complete; ","type":"text"},{"code":"tour","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", when given, lists every vertex exactly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"once; ","type":"text"},{"code":"temperature","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", when given, is finite and at least zero; 0 < ","type":"text"},{"code":"alpha","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ≤ 1;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"maximumIterations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"innerIterations","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are at least zero; the tour’s length fits in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"W","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Precondition"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(n²) to read the weights, then O(1) per move tried, plus O(n) for each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"relocation taken and each new shortest tour."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Complexity"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"varia